The *really* tall guy sporting a new shiny linuxfoundation.org address
that now gets paid to make stable releases [0] released v3.2.5.
Although that release only had one patch in it, we hadn't made any
extra version updates of compat-wireless since the first release of
v3.2 so I have kicked out a new release based on this release [1]
after John kicked me. Its 4 MiB in size and its sha1sum is
e7bcdc038b9f85e74308b175b41560b6d5a31c50. The full ChangeLog is at the
Orbit site [2].

